  "title": "IP, IPv6: Take interface ID and VLAN ID into account during reassembly when prefs.strict_conversation_tracking_heuristics is enabled",
  "description": "Small improvement for #19463 \n\nThe idea was to take VLAN ID and interface ID into account for every conversation tracking, but that would be quite difficult to do without a major rethinking of the conversation logic.\n\nFor now just take interface ID and VLAN ID into account during IPv4 and IPv6 reassembly.",
